────────────────────
+ do markup-batch-did-flush
    - flush MarkupBatchFlush

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do apply-step
    - step Size

. kind = step % 3
if kind == 0
    select-index((step * 17 + 11) % rows.length)
else if kind == 1
    status.text = "status-${step}-${selected-index % 13}"
else
    . row = rows[(step * 19 + 5) % rows.length]
    row.text = "row-${row.index}-edit-$step"

────────────────────
+ do select-index
    - index Size

rows[selected-index].is-selected = false
selected-index = index
rows[selected-index].is-selected = true

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ DamageBenchRow is Label

+ index Size
+ is-selected = false

